う〜ん
Hmm...

1158
01:16:05,820 --> 01:16:07,620
なんか、高岡市
Looks like Takaoka City.

1159
01:16:09,220 --> 01:16:11,820
高岡市多くない？高岡市多いのじゃ。高岡市
Aren't we getting Takaoka City a lot? There's so much of it. Takaoka City...

1160
01:16:15,020 --> 01:16:18,920
えーっと、高岡市の中のどこ、という話なのじゃが
Well, the question is where exactly in Takaoka City we are.

1161
